Hello devops the data which we stored is gone

Containers are ephemeral
When pod dies, data is gone
This is a major problem for stateful application
MySQL -> database file
mongodb -> documents
reddis -> cache
wordpress -> uploads
....


K8S provides two types of solutions:
	Volumes : Storage that we attach to the pod
		  emptyDir{} -> its a temporary volume
	Persistent storage
$ vi nginx-emptydir.yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata: 
  name: nginx-emptydir
spec: 
  replicas: 1
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: nginx-emptydir
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: nginx-emptydir
    spec: 
      containers:
      - name: nginx
        image: nginx
        volumeMounts:
        - name: cache-volume
          mountPath: /data
        volumes:
        - name: cache-volume
          emptydir: {}

$ kubectl apply -f nginx-emptydir-yaml

$ kubectl get pods
